 mechanism, establishing a negative feedback loop that limits MAPK signaling (Catalanotti et al, 2009; Brunet et al, 1994; Xu et al, 1999). Deletion of MAP2K1 or mutation of this site prolongs MAP2K2 AL phosphorylation and MAPK activation (Catalanotti et al, 2009).", "className": "Summation", "schemaClass": "Summation"}], "reviewStatus": {"dbId": 9821382, "displayName": "five stars", "definition": "externally reviewed", "name": ["five stars"], "className": "ReviewStatus", "schemaClass": "ReviewStatus"}, "isChimeric": false, "category": "transition", "catalystActivity": [{"dbId": 5674493, "displayName": "protein serine/threonine kinase activity of p-T,Y MAPK monomers and dimers [cytosol]", "catalyzedEvent": [5674496], "physicalEntity": {"dbId": 5674340, "displayName": "p-T,Y MAPK monomers and dimers [cytosol]", "stId": "R-HSA-5674340", "stIdVersion": "R-HSA-5674340.1", "maxDepth": 4, "name": ["p-T,Y MAPK monomers and dimers"], "speciesName": "Homo sapiens", "catalystActivities": [5674493], "className": "Set", "inDisease": false, "schemaClass": "DefinedSet"}, "className": "CatalystActivity", "schemaClass": "CatalystActivity"}], "input": [{"dbId": 113592, "displayName": "ATP [cytosol]", "stId": "R-ALL-113592", "stIdVersion": "R-ALL-113592.5", "maxDepth": 1, "name": ["ATP", "Adenosine 5'-triphosphate", "ATP(4-)"], "crossReference": [{"dbId": 29359, "displayName": "COMPOUND:C00002", "databaseName": "COMPOUND", "identifier": "C00002", "url": "https://www.kegg.jp/entry/C00002", "className": "DatabaseIdentifier", "schemaClass": "DatabaseIdentifier"}], "isRequired": [{"dbId": 72781, "displayName": "Requirement by 'ATP [cytosol]'", "stId": "R-HSA-72781", "stIdVersion": "R-HSA-72781.1", "regulator": 113592, "schemaClass": "Requirement", "className": "Requirement"}], "negativelyRegulates": [{"dbId": 453366, "displayName": "Negative regulation by 'ATP [cytosol]'", "stId": "R-HSA-453366", "stIdVersion": "R-HSA-453366.1", "regulator": 113592, "schemaClass": "NegativeRegulation", "